00:42:22.130 --> 00:42:28.690
We hired extra camera operators, and we had one crew back in the break room with Dwight.

957
00:42:28.830 --> 00:42:31.930
We had another crew with us in the conference room.

958
00:42:32.090 --> 00:42:33.570
This was all live.

959
00:42:33.710 --> 00:42:35.550
We filmed both sides at the same time.

960
00:42:35.550 --> 00:42:40.590
But John Krasinski, who was in the conference room, was directing this episode.

